"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.rc.custom_build [7f0686c25], v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Single-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7270) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.14 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nNodePath Property exported with usage hint `PROPERTY_USAGE_NODE_PATH_FROM_SCENE_ROOT` does not actually differ from normal NodePath property.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a node class script\n- Create a resource class script\n    - Export a (real) NodePath property, whose usage is set in `_validate_property` to `PROPERTY_USAGE_NODE_PATH_FROM_SCENE_ROOT`\n- Add node class script to a Node in the scene\n    - Assign a resource of whatever type the resource class script defines\n    - Pick a node from the editor to set the exported property\n        - **The path in the property is still relative to the node hosting the resource.** \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-exported-nodepath.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22448537/test-exported-nodepath.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"vitawrap","id":25990455,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTkwNDU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25990455?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitawrap","html_url":"https://github.com/vitawrap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitawrap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitawrap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitawrap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitawrap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs